        <div class="border-b-2 border-gray-900 inline-block px-8 py-1">
          <h2 id="certStudentName" class="text-2xl font-bold text-emerald-700 italic">AP Stat Student Master</h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          has successfully cracked all 6 vaults in the <strong>Binomial Distributions Championship Escape Room</strong>, demonstrating mastery of Binomial Probability, Mean, and Standard Deviation (AP Statistics CED Unit 2).
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 max-w-md mx-auto pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">
          <div>
